1. import the rigged mesh + armature into unity (copy the file, named accordingly, into this folder (the humans folder))
2. drag the the object into the scene
3. unpack the prefab
4. drag the skeleton gameobject into the Armatures group
5. delete the original gameobject + mesh objects that you just dragged in
6. add a DVO_Armature component to the new skeleton gameobject
7. set fields accordingly
8. update human models with the new armature type (gameobjects in the Human Model group)